# TAKY Git is governance/implementation, not a data vault.
# At any nesting level, avoid tracking originals and captured/private data.
**/SOURCE_ARCHIVE/
**/RAW_SOURCE_ARCHIVE/
**/90_RAW_SOURCE_ARCHIVE/
**/SOURCE_VAULT/
**/TAKY-SOURCE-VAULT/
**/WORK_OS_SOURCE_CACHE/
**/captures_v04/
**/acquired_external/
**/data/notion_incremental/
**/SOURCE_REFERENCE/runtime/

# User-linked/host-specific state and credentials.
*.local.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.p12
*.pfx
*.key

# Do not blanket-ignore app source/assets or PWA runtime configurations.
